<i>♪ Fine, as you wish ♪</i>

1346
01:19:36,920 --> 01:19:41,880
<i>♪ I can't, I won't stop you ♪</i>

1347
01:19:44,480 --> 01:19:49,160
<i>♪ I know you don't want to hurt me ♪</i>

1348
01:19:51,040 --> 01:19:55,640
<i>♪ Damn, I can never say no to you ♪</i>

1349
01:19:58,440 --> 01:20:03,320
<i>♪ Leave if you need to ♪</i>

1350
01:20:05,040 --> 01:20:10,240
<i>♪ I won't stand in your way ♪</i>

1351
01:20:12,400 --> 01:20:17,520
<i>♪ Like a spoiled kid with loads of toys ♪</i>

1352
01:20:19,200 --> 01:20:24,640
<i>♪ You're used to material love ♪</i>

1353
01:20:26,160 --> 01:20:29,160
<i>♪ I'll go my own way ♪</i>

1354
