1376
01:22:49,240 --> 01:22:52,320
[news anchor] <i>As usual,
Sydney was among the first cities</i>

1377
01:22:52,400 --> 01:22:55,760
<i>to welcome the New Year with celebrations.</i>

1378
01:22:55,840 --> 01:22:59,160
<i>Let's remind our viewers
that heavy snowfall is forecasted</i>

1379
01:22:59,240 --> 01:23:02,040
<i>on the last day of the year.</i>

1380
01:23:02,120 --> 01:23:06,440
<i>Local blizzards can be expected,
especially around midnight.</i>

1381
01:23:13,840 --> 01:23:15,640
