1382
01:23:24,720 --> 01:23:26,880
<i>You're very lucky.
There's been a last-minute cancellation.</i>

1383
01:23:26,960 --> 01:23:28,320
<i>All you have to do is fill out the form.</i>

1384
01:23:28,920 --> 01:23:32,480
[Selen] <i>Um,
I'd be grateful if I'm not disturbed.</i>

1385
01:23:32,560 --> 01:23:34,560
[hotel clerk]
<i>Won't you join our New Year's party?</i>

1386
01:23:34,640 --> 01:23:37,000
Oh, no. Please pretend I'm not here.

1387
01:23:37,080 --> 01:23:38,080
[hotel clerk] Okay.

1388
01:23:43,520 --> 01:23:46,640
DO NOT DISTURB

1389
