DECEMBER 31

1390
01:23:51,160 --> 01:23:53,160
[♪ melancholy music playing]

1391
01:24:27,320 --> 01:24:29,440
[TV host 1] <i>Let's see
which of your favorite celebrities are</i>

1392
01:24:29,520 --> 01:24:32,080
<i>on tonight's special New Year program.</i>

1393
01:24:44,320 --> 01:24:50,120
[TV host 2] <i>Some elephants leave their
herd when they sense they're about to die.</i>

1394
01:24:50,680 --> 01:24:54,280
<i>They walk slowly toward a barren expanse.</i>

1395
01:24:54,360 --> 01:24:58,720
<i>No goodbyes, no looking back.</i>

1396
01:24:58,800 --> 01:25:01,040
<i>They want to die alone.</i>

1397
01:25:01,120 --> 01:25:04,360
<i>Quietly, without upsetting others.</i>

1398
01:26:10,720 --> 01:26:16,480
[crowd] Ten, nine, eight, seven, six,

1399
01:26:16,560 --> 01:26:21,560
five, four, three, two, one! [cheers]

1400
