Wait!

1414
01:27:18,000 --> 01:27:19,000
Wait!

1415
01:27:19,080 --> 01:27:20,840
[employee] The ferry service has ended.

1416
01:27:20,920 --> 01:27:22,920
- Sea-taxis are nearby.
- [grunts]

1417
01:27:23,000 --> 01:27:24,200
On the right.

1418
01:27:24,280 --> 01:27:25,560
[coughs]

1419
01:27:43,840 --> 01:27:47,400
Selenkins

1420
01:28:02,360 --> 01:28:04,240
Can you drive faster?

1421
01:28:04,320 --> 01:28:05,360
Please. Go faster.

1422
01:28:15,080 --> 01:28:17,160
[breathing heavily]

1423
01:28:46,120 --> 01:28:48,280
[breathing shakily]

1424
01:28:56,680 --> 01:28:57,720
[sniffles]

1425
01:29:16,520 --> 01:29:18,160
Yes, I'm sure.

1426
01:29:18,720 --> 01:29:21,280
Alcohol poisoning. He's about to die.

1427
01:29:21,840 --> 01:29:23,760
I gave the address earlier.

1428
01:29:25,480 --> 01:29:26,920
Yes, I'm waiting.

1429
01:29:27,000 --> 01:29:28,920
- [Murat] Watch it, lady.
- [Selen] Sorry.

1430
01:29:30,440 --> 01:29:32,480
[♪ tense music playing]

1431
01:29:35,080 --> 01:29:36,160
It's you.

1432
01:29:37,320 --> 01:29:39,320
It's you. Fucking bitch!

1433
01:29:39,920 --> 01:29:42,120
I've been looking for you for months.

1434
01:29:42,200 --> 01:29:43,400
For months.

1435
01:29:43,480 --> 01:29:45,880
You fucked up my life!

1436
01:29:47,520 --> 01:29:49,560
I can't see my child now.

1437
01:29:49,640 --> 01:29:52,200
They won't let me see him.

1438
01:29:53,120 --> 01:29:54,680
Happy now?

1439
01:29:54,760 --> 01:29:56,840
Are you happy now?

1440
01:29:56,920 --> 01:29:58,360
Happy now?

1441
01:29:58,440 --> 01:29:59,880
I'm asking you.

1442
01:29:59,960 --> 01:30:01,720
You interfered.

1443
01:30:01,800 --> 01:30:04,640
You ruined my life.

1444
01:30:05,720 --> 01:30:08,480
- I'm going to kill you.
- Let go!

1445
01:30:08,560 --> 01:30:10,160
I'll kill you. Die!

1446
01:30:10,840 --> 01:30:12,840
[breathing shakily]

1447
01:30:12,920 --> 01:30:14,920
[Murat grunting]

1448
01:30:20,520 --> 01:30:23,400
- [Selen] Let go. Back off. Leave me alone.
- [Murat gasps]

1449
01:30:23,480 --> 01:30:25,360
Back off. Back off.

1450
01:30:25,440 --> 01:30:26,440
[groans]

1451
01:30:28,040 --> 01:30:29,480
Back off.

1452
01:30:31,200 --> 01:30:32,640
- Shoot me!
- Back off.

1453
01:30:33,800 --> 01:30:34,800
Go on!

1454
01:30:37,080 --> 01:30:39,320
You took my son from me.

1455
01:30:39,400 --> 01:30:43,160
- Do it!
- [crowd] ...two, one! [exclaiming, cheering]

1456
01:30:45,720 --> 01:30:47,320
[gunshots]

1457
01:30:47,400 --> 01:30:49,400
[crowd screaming, clamoring]

1458
01:30:53,040 --> 01:30:55,480
[witness] Someone's been shot!

1459
01:30:57,840 --> 01:30:59,080
[gasps]

1460
01:31:17,880 --> 01:31:21,720
Selen! Help! Help!

1461
01:31:21,800 --> 01:31:22,800
Selen.

1462
01:31:23,520 --> 01:31:24,560
Look at me, dear.

1463
01:31:24,640 --> 01:31:26,680
I'm here. Look at me. Look at me.

1464
01:31:26,760 --> 01:31:27,840
Look at me.

1465
01:31:28,440 --> 01:31:30,440
Call an ambulance!

1466
01:31:30,520 --> 01:31:32,200
Please help!

1467
01:31:32,920 --> 01:31:34,960
Selen, it's going to be okay.

1468
01:31:35,040 --> 01:31:37,560
Look at me. [breathes heavily]

1469
01:31:38,240 --> 01:31:40,120
Look at me. It's okay. Everything's fine.
You're going to be okay.

1470
01:31:40,200 --> 01:31:44,400
Help is coming. Okay. Ambulance! Help!

1471
01:31:45,200 --> 01:31:47,000
Can no one hear me?

1472
01:31:47,080 --> 01:31:49,400
- Selen!
- Kemal. [gasps]

1473
01:31:49,480 --> 01:31:50,840
Selen, take it easy.

1474
01:31:50,920 --> 01:31:53,360
Easy does it. Help is coming. Okay.

1475
01:31:54,080 --> 01:31:55,200
- It was...
- [Kemal] Huh?

1476
01:31:55,280 --> 01:31:56,480
...the best 198...

1477
01:31:58,560 --> 01:32:04,200
The best 198 days of my life.

1478
01:32:04,280 --> 01:32:05,960
What?

1479
01:32:06,920 --> 01:32:08,640
Thank you.

1480
01:32:08,720 --> 01:32:11,960
No. Look at me. Help is coming.

1481
01:32:13,040 --> 01:32:14,600
Okay, the ambulance is on its way.

1482
01:32:15,480 --> 01:32:17,320
Okay. Selen, Selen. Stay with me.

1483
01:32:17,400 --> 01:32:19,600
Selen, help is coming. Hang on.

1484
01:32:22,760 --> 01:32:23,760
Selen.

1485
01:32:24,840 --> 01:32:26,160
Selen.

1486
01:32:26,240 --> 01:32:27,240
Don't die.

1487
01:32:29,080 --> 01:32:30,080
Selen!

1488
01:32:30,920 --> 01:32:31,960
Don't die, Selen!

